The user will ask something like: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm married filing jointly in Chicago IL. W-2 from Riverside Hospital: $79,400. Additional income: $22,100 (IT contracting, 2 clients), $1,780 from Discover Ban..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


